---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Your Name Screen & Enclosure — Central Florida Pool Enclosures & Screen Rooms"
description: "Central Florida's trusted screen enclosure company. Pool enclosures, screen rooms, porch enclosures, and rescreening — permitted, Florida Building Code compliant, and built to last. Call (407) 555-0194."
---

  <!-- HERO: light mesh-texture bg, copy left + quote form card right -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-inner">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <span class="hero-eyebrow">Serving {{ site.areaServed }} since {{ site.founded }}</span>
        <h1>Screen Enclosures Built for Florida Living</h1>
        <p class="hero-lead">Pool cages, screen rooms, porch enclosures, and rescreening — all permitted, Florida Building Code compliant, and installed by a crew that shows up on time.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneHref }}" class="btn btn--accent btn--lg">Call {{ site.phone }}</a>
          <a href="{{ '/services/' | url }}" class="btn btn--outline btn--lg">View Our Services</a>
        </div>
        <ul class="hero-badges">
          <li>Permits handled for you</li>
          <li>{{ site.rating }}★ from {{ site.reviewCount }}+ reviews</li>
          <li>Licensed &amp; insured</li>
          <li>Free estimates</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-form-card">
        <h3>Get a Free Estimate</h3>
        <p class="form-subhead">We'll contact you within one business day.</p>
        <form class="hero-form" method="POST" action="#" novalidate>
          <input type="text" name="_gotcha" style="display:none" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">
          <div class="field">
            <label for="h-name">Your Name</label>
            <input type="text" id="h-name" name="name" autocomplete="name" required>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="h-phone">Phone Number</label>
            <input type="tel" id="h-phone" name="phone" autocomplete="tel" required>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="h-service">What are you looking for?</label>
            <select id="h-service" name="service">
              <option value="">Select a service…</option>
              {%- for s in services.list %}
              <option value="{{ s.slug }}">{{ s.name }}</option>
              {%- endfor %}
              <option value="other">Not sure yet</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn--accent btn--block btn--lg">Request Free Estimate</button>
          <p class="hero-form-note">No obligation · No spam · Just a real call from a local crew</p>
          <p role="status" aria-live="polite" style="text-align:center;color:var(--sky-dark);font-weight:600;min-height:1.5em;margin:0;"></p>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TRUST STRIP -->
  <div class="trust-strip">
    <div class="container trust-inner">
      <div><strong>20+ yrs</strong><span>Serving Central FL</span></div>
      <div><strong>{{ site.rating }}★</strong><span>{{ site.reviewCount }}+ Reviews</span></div>
      <div><strong>Permitted</strong><span>Every Job</span></div>
      <div><strong>Licensed</strong><span>&amp; Fully Insured</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- HOW IT WORKS — moved up: sets context before the service list -->
  <section class="section section--alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="eyebrow">The Process</span>
        <h2>Simple From First Call to Final Inspection</h2>
        <p>We handle the complicated part — permits, inspections, and code compliance — so you just enjoy the result.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="process-grid">
        <div class="process-step">
          <div class="process-num">1</div>
          <h3>Free On-Site Estimate</h3>
          <p>We come to you, measure the space, discuss options and screen types, and give you a written quote the same day — no vague ballparks.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step">
          <div class="process-num">2</div>
          <h3>We Handle the Permits</h3>
          <p>We submit the permit application, handle the back-and-forth with the county, and schedule inspections. You don't lift a finger.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step">
          <div class="process-num">3</div>
          <h3>Installation &amp; Inspection</h3>
          <p>Our crew installs your enclosure, and we schedule the final county inspection. When it passes, you're done — and protected.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SERVICES: alternating feature rows (replaces 3-col card grid) -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="eyebrow">What We Build</span>
        <h2>Screen Enclosure Services in {{ site.areaServed }}</h2>
        <p>From a new pool cage to rescreening a single torn panel — all permitted, Florida Building Code compliant.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-feature-list">
        {%- for s in services.list %}
        <div class="service-feature-item {% if loop.index is even %}service-feature-item--flip{% endif %}">
          <div class="service-feature-visual">
            <span class="service-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">{{ s.icon }}</span>
            <span class="service-feature-num">0{{ loop.index }}</span>
          </div>
          <div class="service-feature-body">
            <h3>{{ s.name }}</h3>
            <p>{{ s.short }}</p>
            <a href="{{ '/services/' | url }}#{{ s.slug }}" class="link-arrow">View details</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- REVIEWS: rating aggregate left + stacked reviews right -->
  <section class="section section--sand">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="reviews-split">
        <div class="reviews-aggregate">
          <span class="eyebrow">Customer Reviews</span>
          <div class="aggregate-score">{{ site.rating }}</div>
          <div class="aggregate-stars" aria-label="4.9 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</div>
          <p class="aggregate-count">Based on {{ site.reviewCount }}+ reviews<br>across Google &amp; Angi</p>
          <a href="{{ '/reviews/' | url }}" class="btn btn--accent" style="margin-top:12px;">Read All Reviews</a>
        </div>
        <div class="reviews-stack">
          {%- for r in reviews.list %}
          <div class="review-row">
            <div class="review-row-stars" aria-label="{{ r.stars }} stars">{% for i in range(0, r.stars) %}★{% endfor %}</div>
            <p class="review-row-text">{{ r.text }}</p>
            <div class="review-row-attr">{{ r.name }} <span>— {{ r.city }}</span></div>
          </div>
          {%- endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SERVICE AREAS: county cards (uses the county hierarchy data) -->
  <section class="section section--sky">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="eyebrow">Service Area</span>
        <h2>Serving Four Counties Across Central Florida</h2>
        <p>Based in Orlando — if you're in the greater Central Florida area, we come to you.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="county-grid">
        {%- for county in areas.counties %}
        <div class="county-card county-card--light">
          <h3>{{ county.name }}</h3>
          <p>{{ county.cities | join(", ") }}</p>
        </div>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
      <div class="center"><a href="{{ '/service-areas/' | url }}" class="link-arrow" style="color:#fff;">Full service area details</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="eyebrow">Common Questions</span>
        <h2>Things People Ask Before They Call</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-list">
        {%- for item in faq.list %}
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3 class="faq-q">{{ item.q }}</h3>
          <p class="faq-a">{{ item.a }}</p>
        </div>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

{% include "partials/cta.njk" %}
